cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Rankwright: an SEO, AEO and GEO toolkit"
message: "If you use Rankwright in your work, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Mahir (mahirakash)"
  - family-names: Rahman
    given-names: S M Moshiur
    affiliation: TICON System Limited
repository-code: "https://github.com/mahirakash/rankwright"
url: "https://github.com/mahirakash/rankwright"
abstract: >-
  Rankwright audits websites across search-engine, answer-engine and
  generative-engine criteria, generates machine-ingestible ground truth
  (llms.txt, llms-full.txt, facts.json) and JSON-LD, submits changed URLs
  through IndexNow, tracks rankings, and publishes approved changes. It is a
  fork of OmniRank by S M Moshiur Rahman.
references:
  - type: software
    title: OmniRank
    authors:
      - family-names: Rahman
        given-names: S M Moshiur
    repository-code: "https://github.com/bemoshiur/OmniRank"
    license: MIT
keywords:
  - seo
  - answer-engine-optimization
  - generative-engine-optimization
  - structured-data
  - llms-txt
license: MIT
